   "linuxserver": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-bazarr/compare/development-v1.6.3-beta.32-ls13...development-v1.6.3-beta.33-ls14",
   "upstream": "From newest to oldest:\n- Fixed invalid JSON escape sequences in openai_compatible translator responses [227239a](https://github.com/morpheus65535/bazarr/commit/227239a4715985be75ab4d27d67e785f8a48fd71)\n- Updated the list of supported subtitles providers in README to add missing providers and remove discontinued ones. [d4341e9](https://github.com/morpheus65535/bazarr/commit/d4341e91f5afc3cd198a05cc6be4023e09c16baf)\n- Removed Subs4Free and Subs4Series providers as both sites are no longer working at all since they've been put behind multiple layer of anti-bot protection (Cloudflare, Anubis, etc.). #1470 [0fb3810](https://github.com/morpheus65535/bazarr/commit/0fb381076df458a2cb4b79c078b66f5476a08da7)",
